@samdark If you create a new unit test in codeception with the following code in advanced app and postgres SQL having applied the above migration it fails with an error:

``` php
    User::find()->where(['is_deleted' => false])->all();
```

If I write the same in yii unit tests it passes. There is already a similar test but also with same Table and AR class it passes: https://github.com/yiisoft/yii2/blob/master/tests/unit/framework/db/pgsql/PostgreSQLActiveRecordTest.php#L33
